# Restart half of the resident Knot headed receipt. The first run saved the
# edit through the resident route; this fresh Turnstone process must read it
# back from the resident that stayed alive between applications.
settle 20
key escape
open knot://vault/field-note
settle 5
act Toggle live content
wait
assert content-live
assert snap focused ~ field-note
assert text Resident V1 headed edit
assert text saved
capture 03_resident_reopened
log Resident Knot save reopened through a fresh Turnstone process
